---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<section class="start">
  <div class="cta">
    <h2>Coat your first service.</h2>
    <p>Start a new API in a few minutes, or add Zinc to a service you already run.</p>
  </div>
  <nav class="paths" aria-label="Ways to start with Zinc">
    <a href="/guide/quickstart/">
      <span class="label">New service</span>
      <strong>Build your first Zinc API</strong>
      <span class="desc">From <code>go mod init</code> to a running route.</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/cookbook/existing-net-http-service/">
      <span class="label">Existing service</span>
      <strong>Adopt Zinc inside net/http</strong>
      <span class="desc">Keep your server, handlers, and middleware.</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/cookbook/">
      <span class="label">Recipes</span>
      <strong>Browse the cookbook</strong>
      <span class="desc">CRUD, SSE, WebSockets, TLS, graceful shutdown.</span>
    </a>
  </nav>
</section>

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="brand">
    <span class="wordmark">Zinc</span>
    <p>Zn · 30 · 65.38<br />Maintained by Carbon Software Ltd.<br />© 2024–{year} Matt J. Stevenson and contributors</p>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <h3>Docs</h3>
    <a href="/guide/quickstart/">Quickstart</a>
    <a href="/guide/routing/">Routing</a>
    <a href="/middleware/overview/">Middleware</a>
    <a href="/cookbook/">Cookbook</a>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <h3>Project</h3>
    <a href="https://github.com/0mjs/zinc">GitHub</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/0mjs/zinc/releases">Releases</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/0mjs/zinc/issues">Issues</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/0mjs/zinc/blob/dev/CONTRIBUTING.md">Contributing</a>
  </div>
  <div class="col">
    <h3>Resources</h3>
    <a href="https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/0mjs/zinc">API reference</a>
    <a href="/extra/benchmarks/">Benchmarks</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/0mjs/zinc/blob/dev/LICENSE">MIT License</a>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .start {
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--z-text);
    font: 600 clamp(1.9rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem) / 1.08 var(--sl-font);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .cta p {
    color: var(--z-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 34ch;
  }

  .paths {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .paths a {
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--z-text);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    position: relative;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 140ms ease, background 140ms ease;
  }

  .paths a::after {
    color: var(--z-soft);
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.15rem;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    transition: transform 140ms ease, color 140ms ease;
  }

  .paths a:hover {
    background: var(--z-zn-soft);
    border-color: var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
  }

  .paths a:hover::after {
    color: var(--z-text);
    transform: translate(3px, -50%);
  }

  .label {
    color: var(--z-muted);
    font: 500 0.7rem/1 var(--sl-font-mono);
  }

  .paths strong {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .desc {
    color: var(--z-muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .desc code {
    font: 400 0.9em var(--sl-font-mono);
  }

  .foot {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2rem 4rem;
    margin-top: 4.5rem;
    padding-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  .brand {
    flex: 1 1 14rem;
  }

  .wordmark {
    color: var(--z-text);
    font: 400 0.8rem/1 var(--z-font-display);
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .brand p {
    color: var(--z-soft);
    font: 400 0.74rem/1.7 var(--sl-font-mono);
    margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
  }

  .col {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-content: start;
  }

  .col h3 {
    color: var(--z-muted);
    font: 500 0.72rem/1 var(--sl-font-mono);
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
  }

  .col a {
    color: var(--z-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .col a:hover {
    color: var(--z-text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 60rem) {
    .start {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
